0640:                   **** ADDED 06/19/2004 ****
0640:                   * Call to SS.VarSect in Driver:
0640:                   *
0640:                   * This code calls the driver's SS.VarSect GetStat, which will
0640:                   * update the PD.TYP byte in the path descriptor to the sector
0640:                   * size of the media to which this path references.
0640:                   * If the driver doesn't support the GetStat, it will return
0640:                   * an error, and won't touch the PD.TYP anyway, so we ignore it.
